# PLACE — it puts a block down where it is used or where it lands.
#
# ONLY into replaceable space (air, grass, water). Without that guard a thrown bucket eats whatever
# it hits, which turns "buckets for my green lava" into a tool that deletes your house.
#
# The setblock line is rendered by the tool (PLACES): BLOCK may be a LIST picked from each use.
function effect()
${PLACES}
    /particle minecraft:cloud ~ ~0.5 ~ 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.01 10 force
    /playsound minecraft:block.stone.place master @a ~ ~ ~ 1 1
end
